ermanent link">=EE=A0=86</a></h1>
<p>Describes the implementation as of <strong>0.9.2</strong> (commits <code=
>8ee54aa</code>, <code>d0233eb</code>, <code>e0291bd</code>, <code>77136d6<=
/code>, all 2026-09-15). Written 2026-09-15 from the code, not from the des=
ign note; where the two differ, =C2=A71.6 says so. Companion to <a href=3D"=
file:///Users/harryAtMac/p33_haldraw_info_and_repo/haldraw/docs/Vectorize_r=
aster_design.md">Vectorize_raster_design.md</a>, which holds the intent and=
 the decision record.</p>
<p>Audience: someone who wants to know exactly what happens between pressin=
g <strong>Vectorize=E2=80=A6</strong> and seeing shapes on a Draft layer, i=
ncluding every byte that goes to the model and every rule applied to what c=
omes back.</p>
