#b9-error-taxonomy" title=3D"Permanent link">=EE=A0=86</a></h3>
<p><code>VectorizeError</code> carries a <code>kind</code> used only for cl=
assification; the renderer shows <code>message</code> in a red toast for 9 =
s.</p>
<table>
