<p>Nothing is inserted on any error path; the store is untouched until <cod=
e>insertMany</code> in Step D.</p>
<h3 id=3D"b10-the-test-seam">B.10 The test seam<a class=3D"headerlink" href=
=3D"file:///private/var/folders/hj/hx1hqg8908nf89fbssd6mq5h0000gv/T/92.html=
#b10-the-test-seam" title=3D"Permanent link">=EE=A0=86</a></h3>
<p>If the environment variable <code>HALDRAW_VECTORIZE_FAKE</code> names a =
JSON file, <code>runVectorize</code> reads it, validates it with <code>vali=
dateResult</code> against the request=E2=80=99s <code>width</code>/<code>he=
ight</code>, and returns it as <code>{ result, model: 'fake', inputTokens: =
0, outputTokens: 0 }</code> without touching the keychain or the network. O=
nly a launcher that sets the variable sees this; the packaged app opened fr=
om Finder never has it. It exists so Steps C=E2=80=93E (mapping, layer, ins=
ert, grouping, undo) can be exercised deterministically in an isolated inst=
ance. Because the fake bypasses the schema constraint, this path is why <co=
de>validateResult</code> re-checks kinds and numeric types.</p>
