<h3 id=3D"c1-coordinate-mapping">C.1 Coordinate mapping<a class=3D"headerli=
nk" href=3D"file:///private/var/folders/hj/hx1hqg8908nf89fbssd6mq5h0000gv/T=
/92.html#c1-coordinate-mapping" title=3D"Permanent link">=EE=A0=86</a></h3>
<p>The model=E2=80=99s boxes are in sent-image pixels. The reference node o=
ccupies a rectangle on the board that the user chose at import (original si=
ze, fit, or a percentage) and may have moved or resized since. The mapping =
is an independent affine scale per axis plus the node=E2=80=99s offset:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight"><pre>  sx =3D ref.width  / sent.width
  sy =3D ref.height / sent.height

  node.x      =3D ref.x + s.x * sx
  node.y      =3D ref.y + s.y * sy
  node.width  =3D max(4, s.w * sx)
  node.height =3D max(4, s.h * sy)
</pre></div>

