<h3 id=3D"c3-fill-stroke-and-text-colour">C.3 Fill, stroke and text colour<=
a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"file:///private/var/folders/hj/hx1hqg8908nf8=
9fbssd6mq5h0000gv/T/92.html#c3-fill-stroke-and-text-colour" title=3D"Perman=
ent link">=EE=A0=86</a></h3>
<p>Helper: <code>colour(v, fallback)</code> returns <code>v.toLowerCase()</=
code> if <code>v</code> matches <code>/^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/i</code>, else <code>=
fallback</code>. So <code>""</code>, <code>#fff</code>, <code>rgb(=E2=80=A6=
)</code>, <code>"white"</code> all mean =E2=80=9Cunknown=E2=80=9D.</p>
<div class=3D"highlight"><pre>  fill:
    kind =3D=3D text =E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=
=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=
=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=
=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=96=B6 'transparent'
    else colour(s.fill, 'transparent')      (unknown fill stays see-through=
 so the reference shows)

  stroke:
    kind =3D=3D text =E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=
=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=
